10:18.034 --> 10:19.577
&gt;&gt; You fellows look hungry.
>> 你们这些家伙看起来很饿。

10:19.660 --> 10:21.454
Here you go.
干得好。

10:23.706 --> 10:25.583
&gt;&gt; Excuse me, sir.
>> 对不起，先生。

10:25.666 --> 10:28.044
My resignation.
我的辞职。

10:28.127 --> 10:30.963
&gt;&gt; But you're my whole
marketing department.
>> 但你是我的全部
营销部。

10:31.047 --> 10:33.466
&gt;&gt; I know,
but I'm burned out.
>> 我知道，
但我已经筋疲力尽了。

10:33.549 --> 10:35.176
See?
看？

10:35.259 --> 10:38.554
Anyway, you can send my check
to my home.
不管怎样，你可以寄给我支票
到我家。

10:38.637 --> 10:40.097
&gt;&gt; Check?
>> 检查？

10:40.181 --> 10:43.142
You want money
for those stupid catchphrases?
你想要钱
为了那些愚蠢的口号？

10:43.225 --> 10:46.479
Anybody can sell
to my idiot customers.
任何人都可以卖
给我的白痴顾客。

10:46.562 --> 10:47.980
They're buffoons!
他们是小丑！

10:48.064 --> 10:49.190
Morons!
白痴！

10:49.273 --> 10:51.108
They'll buy anything
I sell them.
他们什么都会买
我卖掉它们。

10:51.192 --> 10:53.986
They're the dumbest of the dumb.
他们是傻子中最傻的。

10:54.070 --> 10:57.156
The stupidest of the stupid.
愚者中最愚者。

10:57.239 --> 11:00.284
They're dummies, dweebs,
and doo-doo dunderheads.
他们是傻瓜，笨蛋，
和嘟嘟傻瓜。

11:00.368 --> 11:03.287
I can keep that rabble
right where I want them.
我可以留住那群乌合之众
就在我想要它们的地方。

11:03.371 --> 11:04.747
Huh?
啊？

11:04.830 --> 11:07.833
&gt;&gt; What was that part
about doo-doo dunderheads, eh?
>> 那部分是什么
关于杜杜傻瓜，嗯？

11:07.917 --> 11:09.543
&gt;&gt; Uh-oh.
>> 呃哦。

11:14.757 --> 11:19.178
&gt;&gt; Where do you think
you're going, little man?
>> 你认为在哪里
你要去吗，小男人？

11:19.261 --> 11:22.348
&gt;&gt; Is it too late
for sorry?
>> 是不是太晚了
抱歉？

11:22.431 --> 11:23.349
Oh!
哦！

11:23.432 --> 11:24.767
&gt;&gt;
>>
>>
>>
>>
>>
>>
>>

11:24.850 --> 11:27.645
hey, check out that new sign
at the Krusty Krab.
嘿，看看那个新标志
在蟹堡王。

11:27.728 --> 11:28.854
Who's hungry, Eh?
谁饿了，呃？

11:33.692 --> 11:35.694
&gt;&gt; Well, Mr. K,
we're back in business.
>> 那么，K 先生，
我们恢复营业了。

11:35.778 --> 11:38.864
&gt;&gt; Yep.
Keep up the good work, boyo!
>> 是的。
继续努力，男孩！

11:38.948 --> 11:41.534
&gt;&gt; You got it, boss.
>> 老板，你明白了。

