12:02.304 --> 12:05.057
&gt;&gt; Plankton, is that you?
>> 浮游生物，是你吗？

12:05.141 --> 12:06.892
Welcome home, honey.
欢迎回家，亲爱的。

12:06.976 --> 12:09.562
&gt;&gt;
>>
>>
>>
>>
>>
>>
>>

12:11.689 --> 12:13.441
&gt;&gt; How was your day?
>> 你今天过得怎么样？

12:15.651 --> 12:18.195
Dear Neptune, Plankton!
亲爱的海王星，浮游生物！

12:18.279 --> 12:19.613
What is that smell?
那是什么气味？

12:19.697 --> 12:23.576
&gt;&gt; The aroma you speak of,
Karen, my computer wife,
>> 你所说的香气，
凯伦，我的电脑妻子，

12:23.659 --> 12:26.954
is the stench of failure.
是失败的恶臭。

12:27.037 --> 12:29.832
&gt;&gt; Failure.
>> 失败。

12:29.915 --> 12:33.961
&gt;&gt; And now the smell of defeat
so deeply penetrates my soul
>> 现在失败的味道
如此深深地渗透我的灵魂

12:34.044 --> 12:38.966
that my very skin is permeated
with its foul stench.
我的皮肤都被渗透了
及其恶臭。

12:40.676 --> 12:42.470
Thanks for asking.
谢谢你的询问。

12:42.553 --> 12:43.971
&gt;&gt; Well, it smells horrible.
>> 呃，味道很难闻。

12:44.054 --> 12:47.224
You're not coming in here
smelling like that.
你不会进来的
闻起来像那样。

12:47.308 --> 12:50.186
&gt;&gt; Hey, what are you--
>> 嘿，你在做什么——

12:52.229 --> 12:53.939
Stop that at once!
立刻停止吧！

12:54.023 --> 12:56.025
You--
你 -

13:02.490 --> 13:05.242
Oh, no!
哦，不！

13:17.129 --> 13:18.464
&gt;&gt; There you go.
>> 就这样吧。

13:18.547 --> 13:20.007
Now don't you feel better?
现在你不觉得好点了吗？

13:20.090 --> 13:21.967
&gt;&gt; Although I do look ravishing,
>> 虽然我看起来很迷人，

13:22.051 --> 13:25.596
it's not enough to mask
the ugliness I feel inside.
掩盖还不够
我内心感到的丑陋。

13:25.679 --> 13:29.558
&gt;&gt; Did I miss a spot?
>> 我是不是漏掉了什么地方？

13:29.642 --> 13:33.312
&gt;&gt;
>>
>>
>>
>>
>>
>>
>>

13:33.395 --> 13:35.231
&gt;&gt; Don't blow a gasket, dear.
>> 亲爱的，不要吹掉垫圈。

13:35.314 --> 13:38.692
Today's a special day.
今天是一个特别的日子。

13:38.776 --> 13:40.319
&gt;&gt; Special day?
>> 特别的日子？

13:40.402 --> 13:44.156
&gt;&gt; Yes, we're celebrating your
biggest accomplishment ever.
>> 是的，我们正在庆祝您
有史以来最大的成就。

13:44.240 --> 13:45.741
&gt;&gt; Really?
I accomplished something?
>> 真的吗？
我完成了什么？

13:45.824 --> 13:46.825
What is it?
它是什么？

13:46.909 --> 13:48.911
&gt;&gt; It has something to do
with you
>> 有事可做
和你在一起

13:48.994 --> 13:50.579
asking a certain someone
询问某人

13:50.663 --> 13:53.290
to spend the rest of her life
with you.
度过余生
和你在一起。

13:53.374 --> 13:54.667
&gt;&gt; What?
>> 什么？

13:54.750 --> 13:57.795
&gt;&gt; We each wear rings
in memory of this moment.
>> 我们每个人都戴着戒指
纪念这一刻。

13:57.878 --> 13:59.463
&gt;&gt; Enough with the riddles,
woman.
>> 谜语够了，
女人。

13:59.547 --> 14:03.384
Just tell me what this
proud moment in my life is.
告诉我这是什么
我生命中值得骄傲的时刻是。

14:03.467 --> 14:04.802
&gt;&gt; Oh, you selfish green twit.
>> 哦，你这个自私的绿色傻瓜。

14:04.885 --> 14:06.387
It's our wedding anniversary.
这是我们的结婚纪念日。

14:06.470 --> 14:07.388
&gt;&gt; Oh, that.
>> 哦，那个。

14:07.471 --> 14:09.348
Yippee.
耶皮。

14:09.431 --> 14:10.724
&gt;&gt;
>>
>>
>>
>>
>>
>>
>>

14:10.808 --> 14:15.729
You forgot,
and I got you the perfect gift.
你忘了，
我给你准备了一份完美的礼物。

14:15.813 --> 14:18.232
&gt;&gt; The Krabby Patty formula?
>> 蟹黄饼配方？

14:18.315 --> 14:20.276
Mwah! Mwah!
哇！哇！

14:20.359 --> 14:21.694
How did you get it?
你是怎么得到它的？

14:21.777 --> 14:26.198
&gt;&gt; First
I went to the Krusty Krab.
>> 第一
我去了蟹堡王。

14:26.282 --> 14:28.284
One Krabby Patty, please.
请来一份蟹肉饼。

14:35.332 --> 14:37.167
Thank you.
谢谢。

14:37.251 --> 14:38.377
&gt;&gt; Whatever.
>> 无论如何。

14:38.460 --> 14:40.212
&gt;&gt; Mwah! Mwah! Mwah!
>> 哇！哇！哇！

14:40.296 --> 14:42.423
What?
Sorry, I wasn't listening.
什么？
抱歉，我没在听。

14:42.506 --> 14:43.924
Well, you can tell me later.
嗯，你可以稍后告诉我。

14:44.008 --> 14:47.177
&gt;&gt; You're not getting this
until you get me a gift.
>> 你没有明白这个
直到你给我送礼物。

14:47.261 --> 14:47.970
&gt;&gt;
>>
>>
>>
>>
>>
>>
>>

14:48.053 --> 14:50.389
&gt;&gt; From your heart.
>> 发自内心。

14:50.472 --> 14:52.308
&gt;&gt;
>>
>>
>>
>>
>>
>>
>>

14:56.437 --> 14:57.730
&gt;&gt; And that's the story
>> 这就是故事

14:57.813 --> 15:00.065
of how I got my head
stuck in the fry vat.
我是如何得到我的头的
卡在炸缸里了。

15:00.149 --> 15:04.194
&gt;&gt; That story gets better
every time you tell it, Sponge--
>> 这个故事变得更好了
每次你说出来的时候，海绵——

15:04.278 --> 15:05.237
&gt;&gt; Hold on!
>> 坚持住！

15:05.321 --> 15:06.488
Did you hear that?
你听到了吗？

15:06.572 --> 15:08.198
It sounds like...
听起来像是...

15:08.282 --> 15:12.703
&gt;&gt;
>>
>>
>>
>>
>>
>>
>>

15:12.786 --> 15:14.371
&gt;&gt; Despair.
>> 绝望。

15:14.455 --> 15:16.248
&gt;&gt; That was probably me.
>> 那可能就是我。

15:16.332 --> 15:18.667
&gt;&gt; No, no, not bitterness.
Despair.
>> 不，不，不是苦涩。
绝望。

15:18.751 --> 15:21.587
And it's coming from over...
而且是从那边传来的……

15:21.670 --> 15:24.757
This way.
这边走。

15:26.342 --> 15:27.635
Plankton.
浮游生物。

15:27.718 --> 15:29.595
What's wrong, Plankton?
怎么了，浮游生物？

15:29.678 --> 15:31.430
&gt;&gt; What?
SpongeBob?
>> 什么？
海绵宝宝？

15:31.513 --> 15:33.182
Uh, there's nothing wrong.
呃，没有什么问题。

15:33.265 --> 15:34.183
Don't worry.
不用担心。

15:34.266 --> 15:37.311
I'm fine.
我很好。

15:37.394 --> 15:39.938
&gt;&gt; Come on,
tell your Uncle SpongeBob.
>> 来吧，
告诉你的海绵宝宝叔叔。

15:40.022 --> 15:41.357
&gt;&gt; Oh, it's nothing.
>>哦，没什么。

15:41.440 --> 15:44.109
It's just that today
is my wedding anniversary.
只是今天而已
是我的结婚纪念日。

15:44.193 --> 15:46.612
&gt;&gt; Aw, what present
did you buy your wife, huh?
>> 噢，什么礼物
你老婆是你买的吧？

15:46.695 --> 15:47.780
What did you buy her?
你给她买了什么？

15:47.863 --> 15:50.699
&gt;&gt; Um, I didn't buy Karen
anything.
>> 嗯，我没有买凯伦
任何东西。

15:50.783 --> 15:51.742
&gt;&gt;
>>
>>
>>
>>
>>
>>
>>

15:51.825 --> 15:55.329
We've got a love emergency.
我们遇到了爱情紧急情况。

15:55.412 --> 15:56.413
Attention, everyone.
大家注意了。

15:56.497 --> 15:57.998
We have a love emergency.
我们遇到了爱情紧急情况。

15:58.082 --> 15:59.917
Please stand back.
Love emergency.
请退后一点。
爱紧急情况。

16:00.000 --> 16:01.794
Thank you.
Love emergency.
谢谢。
爱紧急情况。

16:01.877 --> 16:03.545
Plankton,
there's only one thing to do.
浮游生物，
只有一件事要做。

16:03.629 --> 16:06.590
You need to give her a present
from in here.
你需要给她一份礼物
从这里。

16:06.674 --> 16:07.633
&gt;&gt; What,
like a kidney?
>> 什么，
像肾一样？

16:07.716 --> 16:08.884
&gt;&gt; No, from the heart.
>> 不，是发自内心的。

16:08.967 --> 16:10.803
That's where your love grows.
那就是你的爱成长的地方。

16:10.886 --> 16:11.929
&gt;&gt; My what?
>> 我的什么？

16:12.012 --> 16:13.472
&gt;&gt; Your love.
&gt;&gt; My loove?
>> 你的爱。
>> 我的爱人？

16:13.555 --> 16:14.682
&gt;&gt; Love.
&gt;&gt; Loop?
>> 爱。
>> 循环？

16:14.765 --> 16:16.600
&gt;&gt; Luh-vuh.
>> 呜呜。

16:16.684 --> 16:17.601
&gt;&gt; Lump.
>> 肿块。

16:17.685 --> 16:18.602
&gt;&gt; Say it with me:
>> 跟我一起说：

16:18.686 --> 16:20.145
Uhl.
呃。

16:20.229 --> 16:21.397
&gt;&gt; Uhl.
>> 呃。

16:21.480 --> 16:22.523
&gt;&gt; Ahh.
>> 啊。

16:22.606 --> 16:24.191
&gt;&gt; Ahh.
>> 啊。

16:24.274 --> 16:25.401
&gt;&gt; Vhh.
>> 唷。

16:25.484 --> 16:27.319
&gt;&gt;
>>
>>
>>
>>
>>
>>
>>

16:27.403 --> 16:29.655
&gt;&gt; Uh-luh-vuh.
>> 呃-呃-呃。

16:29.738 --> 16:31.323
&gt;&gt;   Love?
>> 爱？

16:31.407 --> 16:32.866
&gt;&gt; That's it!
>> 就是这样！

16:32.950 --> 16:35.327
You've taken the first step
into the halls of amm-nourv.
你已经迈出了第一步
进入amm-nourv的大厅。

16:35.411 --> 16:38.539
Now, tell me more
about your Karen.
现在，告诉我更多
关于你的凯伦。

16:38.622 --> 16:39.873
So what's your favorite thing
那么你最喜欢的事情是什么

16:39.957 --> 16:42.084
for you and Karen
to do together?
为了你和凯伦
一起做？

16:42.167 --> 16:45.504
&gt;&gt; Well, we like to take
long walks on the beach,
>> 好吧，我们喜欢采取
在海滩上长距离散步，

16:45.587 --> 16:47.089
and we talk about our dreams--
我们谈论我们的梦想——

